            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-CONTEMPO-PC\"><b>Laurey Contempo Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 3 sizes, the Polished Chrome Contempo Cabinet Pull is good for modern kitchens. The polished chrome finish is extremely popular in the home decor world right now. The Contempo Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Contempo Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Polished Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-55726:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-55826:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-54526:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
